'''4.''' Being in many volumes; hence, copious enough to make numerous volumes: used of the published writings of an author: as, the ''voluminous'' works of Sir Walter Scott.

'''voluminously''' (vō-lū′mi-nus-li), ''adv.'' In a voluminous manner; in large quantity; copiously; diffusely.
